    <page>
        <paragraphs>
            <title>Other Things to Consider</title>


            <p component="b" workspace="4in">
                Two other things to take into consideration when trying to plot graphs: Domain and Asymptotes.
            </p>
            <p component="a">
                Two other things to take into consideration when trying to plot graphs: Domain and Asymptotes. Need to know if there are any gaps in the domain, as well as vertical and horizontal asymptotes.
            </p>

            <image width="60%">
